msgid "Navigate to the :guilabel:`Your Orders` section of the portal."
msgstr "Siirry portaalissa osioon :guilabel:`Omat tilaukset`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:216
msgid "Select the relevant order."
msgstr "Valitse asianmukainen tilaus."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:217
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-reply` :guilabel:`Return` button."
msgstr "Napsauta painiketta :icon:`fa-reply` :guilabel:`Palauta`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:219
msgid "Return button in the portal."
msgstr "Palauta-painike portaalissa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:222
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request a return` pop-up window, specify the quantity of "
"the product to return and select a :guilabel:`Return reason` from the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""
"Määritä ponnahdusikkunassa :guilabel:`Pyydä palautusta` palautettavan "
"tuotteen määrä ja valitse avattavasta valikosta :guilabel:`Palautussyy`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:224
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Continue` and :guilabel:`Download Return Label` to view and "
