"Valitse sopiva :guilabel:`Sähköpostipohja` ja napsauta "
"sitten :guilabel:`Tallenna`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:255
msgid ""
"If needed, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) icon "
