"applications/general/companies/email_template>`."
msgstr ""
"Napsauta tarvittaessa mallin nimen vieressä olevaa :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
"(:guilabel:`Sisäinen linkki`) -kuvaketta "
"mukauttaaksesi :doc:`sähköpostimallia </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:259
msgid ""
"Customers can view their invoices under :guilabel:`Your Invoices` in "
"the :doc:`portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"Asiakkaat voivat tarkastella laskujaan :guilabel:`Laskusi` "
"-kohdassa :doc:`portaalissa </applications/general/users/user_portals>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:261
msgid ""
"Invoices are only sent automatically if (and when) the :doc:`payment </"
